      ],
      "source": "https://missouririvermt.com/community/wolf-point",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1885 the Great Northern Railroad arrived, ending the era of riverboats in the area.",
